<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Freeday — Blazor Server harness</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/kit/freeday.bundle.css" />
    @* Order matters and is part of what this harness verifies: freeday.js registers the
       window.Freeday* enhancers, and the bridge assumes they already exist. *@
